  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>ESCE International Business School, founded in 1968 by Business France (the French Office for International Trade), is located in La Defense, Paris. The name ESCE stands for Ecole Supérieure du Commerce Extérieur. Since 2012, it has been a member of France's prestigious Conférence des Grandes Ecoles.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At ESCE International Business School, you'll have a dynamic student life with various clubs, events, and support services to help you. The school organises a range of events throughout the year, such as conferences, career fairs, and skill-building workshops, to help you expand your network. ESCE also offers mental health resources and activities to help you maintain a balanced lifestyle.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>ESCE does not provide on-campus housing, but it offers housing support to help you find suitable accommodation nearby. The school works closely with local housing providers to offer a range of options to meet your needs. These include private apartments, shared flats, and student residences close to campus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
